# A WARREN TOWER (src/content/interiors/container_warren.gd, `tower`): the run
# stacked three floors up the heap, the vault at the top, and a crawl up through
# its top container's torn roof that comes out on the plateau BESIDE the alley
# (SlotDoors.exit_beside): the one way up out of the maze besides the ramps.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/warren-tower.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0
#
# 01 is the tower from above, three floors stepping up. 02 is at the crawl in
# the top container (`above`). 03 is out on the plateau over the slot, having
# crawled out (`out_back`).
coast calm
near door:tower
await door 5
wait 0.6
press use 0.1
await inside:container_warren 20
wait 1.0
shot 01-a-tower-from-above with inside:container_warren
near crawl
await crawl_near 3
wait 0.6
shot 02-at-the-crawl-up with inside:container_warren,above
press use 0.1
await out_back 5
wait 1.2
shot 03-out-on-the-plateau with land:the_middens
